        "Description": "This little surburban area may look peaceful and tranquil but living here are four heinous individuals.\r\rNolan Cassidy, Providence Herald.\r\rJanus, 1st Constant of Providence.\r\rHelen West, who may come across as a sweet old lady but she is actually a notorious serial killer.\r\rCharles Blake the III, a vile and hated politician who has riddled the county in nothing but red tape in his tenure.\r\rHappy hunting, 47.",
